<p>I have a script which runs another script via SSH on a remote server usi=
ng <code>sudo</code>.  However, when I type the password, it shows up on th=
e terminal. Otherwise it works fine.</p>
<pre><code>ssh user@server "sudo script"
</code></pre>
<p>What's the proper way to do this so I can type the password for <code>su=
do</code> over SSH without the password appearing as I type?</p>
    </div>

