<p><strong>Assuming you want no password prompt</strong>:</p>

<pre><code>ssh $HOST 'echo $PASSWORD | sudo -S $COMMMAND'
</code></pre>

<p><em>Example</em></p>

<pre><code>ssh me@localhost 'echo secret | sudo -S echo hi' # outputs 'hi'
</code></pre>
